{"work_id":"raja-rani","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-028.md","record_count":64,"records":[{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d001","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சாந்தம்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அடடே! தம்பீ! வாங்க, வாங்க!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d002","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வணக்கம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d003","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"முன்னாலேயே வர்ரேன்னு சொன்னீங்க!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d004","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாங்க!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d005","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நல்லவேளை, இப்பவாவது வந்தீங்களே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d006","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d007","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உட்காருங்க, ஆ...முருகா காப்பி கொண்டு வா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d008","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ!...இல்லீங்க. பரவாயில்லீங்க. காப்பி நான் வரும்போதுதான் சாப்பிட்டு வந்தேன். நானு இங்கே வந்தது...அதாவது நேத்து நான் இங்கே வர்றதுக்கு வரும் போது...அந்த நாய் என்ன...க...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d009","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்ப நேத்து வந்துட்டு நாய்க்கு பயந்து போயிட்டீங்களா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d010","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ!...இல்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d011","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பரவா இல்லே...உட்காருங்க!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d012","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இல்லீங்க! நீங்க ஒண்ணும் என்னை வித்தியாசமா நினைச்சுக்கப்படாது...இந்த நாய் என்னை கடிக்க வந்ததுனால தான்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d013","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அந்த நாய் கடிக்காது; சும்மா கொல்க்கும்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d014","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யய்யே! இல்லியே! அந்த நாய் என்னைக் கடிக்கவந்ததுனாலதானே நான் அங்கே இங்கே ஓடி, சுத்தி இத்தி கடைசிலே...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d015","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வீட்டுக்கே போயிட்டீங்களா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d016","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ! அய்யய்யோ! அய்யய்யோ இது!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d017","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீங்க ஒண்ணுக்கும் பயப்பட வேண்டியதில்லை, நேரா வந்துட வேண்டியதுதான்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d018","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சமரசம்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d019","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சார்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d020","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வந்துட வேண்டியதுதான்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d021","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வணக்கம் சார்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d022","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வச்சுக்க!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d023","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நேத்து ராத்திரி இந்த நாய் கடிக்க வந்து...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d024","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இப்பத்தானே சொன்னேன், அந்த நாய் கடிக்காதுன்னு. ஆமா, நீங்க புது நாடகம் நடத்தப் போறதா கேள்விப்பட்டேனே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d025","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாங்க, அகல்யா நடத்திறதா இருந்தோம்; அது...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d026","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"யப்பா...ஏய்யப்பா! அகல்யாதானே. பஷ்ட்டு நாடகம் நடத்து--நல்ல நாடகம் நல்லா நடத்து! அவளையே அகல்யா போட்டுக்க...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d027","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ! அவரு கெளதம முனிவர் போட்டுக்குவாரு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d028","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமா! அப்புறம் நீ இந்திரன்! நாடகம் முடிஞ்சுது...!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d029","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாங்க...ஆமா! ஆ...சரி! என்ன சார், ரொம்ப கோபமா இருக்கீங்க போலிருக்கு?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":44,"printed_page":43}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d030","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னு கோபம்? நான் கோவிச்சு என்னு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d031","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ...! ஆ...! இல்லை இல்லை! அவரு சமாதான கமிட்டிக்கு மெம்பர்ல, அவரு அப்படித்தான் பேசுவாரு! நீங்க சொல்லுங்க, என்னு நாடகம்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d032","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அது...ஏதாவது சமூக நாடகம் நடத்தலாம்ன்னு, நீங்க அதுக்கு கண்டிப்பா...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d033","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நான் கண்டிப்பா வருவேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d034","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ! சரிங்க, சார்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d035","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னு?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d036","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீங்களும் அதுக்கு கண்டிப்பா...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d037","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அங்க...அங்க...சொல்லிட்டில்லேப்பா...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d038","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சொல்லிட்டேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d039","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சொல்லிட்டில்ல...போதும், போதும்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d040","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீங்க கோவிச்சுக்கப்படாது!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d041","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கோபம்...என்னா கோபம்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d042","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீங்க போங்க, நான் பாத்துக்கறேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d043","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ! சரிங்க, சார்...அப்ப நான்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d044","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆதி...போ டீ! போ...போ நீ!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d045","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"வேலை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இது சந்தேகந்தான்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d046","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னடா சந்தேகம்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d047","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"வேலை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நம்ப கண்ணு மாடு போட்டு இருக்கல்ல...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d048","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கண்ணு மாடு போட்டு இருக்கா? கண்ணு வலை வீசுது...வலை!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d049","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"வேலை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இல்லீங்க...நம்ப மாடு கண்ணு போட்டு இருக்கல்ல...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d050","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d051","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"வேலை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அது பொழக்கிறது சந்தேகம்தான்னு சொன்னேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d052","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எப்படிடா பொழைக்கும்? மனுஷன் நல்ல புத்தியோட இருந்து மாடு வாங்கிட்டு வந்தால்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d053","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"வேலை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமா...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d054","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஏய்! பொம்பளை நல்ல புத்தியோட இருந்து அதை பாதுகாத்தால்ல...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d055","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"வேலை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமா...!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d056","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பொம்பளை புத்தியோடதான்டா இருக்கா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d057","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"புத்தியோட இருக்காளா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d058","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இல்லியா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d059","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இல்லை! இல்லைங்கிறதுக்கு நான் ஆதாரம் காட்டுறேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":45,"printed_page":44}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d060","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதை ஏன் கேக்குறீங்க? அவதான் வர்லியே...ஓகோ...நீங்களே கொண்டு கொடுத்துடலாம்னு கேக்கிறீங்களா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":46,"printed_page":45}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d061","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன. அவ இவன்னு உளர்றே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":46,"printed_page":45}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d062","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன உளர்றேன்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":46,"printed_page":45}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d063","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":46,"printed_page":45}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s028-d064","scene_id":"raja-rani-s028","scene_ordinal":28,"transition_audit_id":"T028","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உண்மையைத்தான் சொல்றேன்...மனுஷன் நல்ல புத்தியோட இல்லைங்கறதுக்கு நான் ஆதாரம் காட்டுறேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":46,"printed_page":45}],"source_scene_file":"scene-028.md"}]}
